# Behold (CR 701.4a) is "choose a Dragon you control or reveal a Dragon card from your hand": Bot1 has both here, so the
# choice is between its Phyrexian Dragon Engine and the Kokusho in its hand; it chooses the Kokusho, which is revealed (the Revealed key) and stays
# in the hand (nothing moves). A Dragon was beheld, so the ransom is
# {4}; Bot2's Black Lotus leaves {R}{R} and cannot pay, and the Bolt is countered.

